### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 1. Register
# @name register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "email": "juan{{$timestamp}}@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Login (usar email del register o uno existente)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Me (el avatar_url ahora es signed URL)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Refresh token
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### --- Pacientes (requieren token) ---

### 5. Crear paciente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Ana",
  "apellido": "Lopez",
  "fecha_nacimiento": "1990-05-15",
  "tipo_lesion": "hombro",
  "observaciones": "primera sesion"
}

### 6. Listar pacientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 7. Obtener paciente (reemplazar ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/pacientes/ID_DEL_PACIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Actualizar paciente
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/pacientes/ID_DEL_PACIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observaciones": "evolucionando bien"
}

### 9. Eliminar paciente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/pacientes/ID_DEL_PACIENTE
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### --- Uploads (requieren token) ---

### 10. Subir avatar (foto perfil kinesiologo)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/upload/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--boundary123--

### 11. Subir foto de paciente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/upload/paciente-foto
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="foto"; filename="paciente.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./paciente.jpg
--boundary123--

### --- Error cases ---

### Register missing fields
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "incompleto@test.com"
}

### Register duplicate
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "apellido": "Perez",
  "email": "existente@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login wrong password
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### Me no token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Me invalid token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido

### --- OAuth (requieren credenciales reales) ---

### Google callback
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_token": "ID_TOKEN_DE_GOOGLE"
}

### GitHub callback
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/github/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CODE_DE_GITHUB"
}

### 17. Dashboard (resumen)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
